# Forget Me Not (WotG 42) edges, from Batallia Downs. Status 1 (a GM): the Cavernous Maw plays its own script's event
# 500 (xi.maws.onTrigger), whose finish changes nothing. A warp to Grauberg [S] at Status 1 with no Option plays the
# zone-in 33; its finish sets Status 2, then xi.maws.goToMaw gets xi.maws.pastMaws[0], a nil, and raises "attempt to
# index local 'maw' (a nil value)" (the step's expect-error): the char stays. A rezone at Status 2 in Grauberg [S] and
# at Status 0 plays no zone-in event, and the warp to Batallia Downs at Status 0 completes nothing.
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/4 GraubergS/onZoneIn/1 GraubergS/onEventFinish/33
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ForgetMeNot current
charvar Mission[5][41]Status 1
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                      # Status 1: the maw's own script
finish-if-event
warp -140.28,-6.749,585.24 GraubergS open  # Status 1, Option 0: 33
finish expect-error "attempt to index local 'maw' (a nil value)"
tick 400
rezone                                     # Status 2 in Grauberg [S]: no zone-in event
charvar Mission[5][41]Status 0
rezone                                     # Status 0: no zone-in event
warp -48,0.1,435 BatalliaDowns             # Status 0 in Batallia Downs: no completion
